#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:5
msgid "Select language"
msgstr "选择语言"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is a multilingual tool already translated to 21 languages."
msgstr "QElectroTech 是一款多语言工具，已被翻译成 21 种语言。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:9
msgid "To select the working language:"
msgstr "要选择工作语言："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:11
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech 设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:12
msgid "Go to **General** section."
msgstr "转到 **常规** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:13
msgid "Go to **Language** tab."
msgstr "转到 **语言** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:14
msgid "Spread out the combo box and select the desired language."
msgstr "展开组合框并选择所需的语言。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:15
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close settings "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改并关闭设置弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:19
msgid ""
"The changes are applied at the next launch, `quit`_ and `launch`_ again "
"QElectroTech."
msgstr "这些更改会在下次启动时生效，请 `退出 <quit_>`_ 并重新 `启动 <launch_>`_ QElectroTech。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/language.rst:24
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech configure language section"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 配置语言部分"
